    card title "How tall were Dutch men born in 1896?"

A: Dutch men are the tallest in the world: born in 1996, they average about a metre eighty-two. So, for both of you: how tall were Dutch men born a century earlier?
    draw man flag h

B: People were shorter back then. I'll say a metre seventy-five.
    draw bguess

    ask "Click on the line where you think it is." on h store g default "175"
        right: Yes, about a hundred and sixty-nine centimetres.
        wrong: It was about a hundred and sixty-nine centimetres.

    erase bguess

    erase h man flag

B: A hundred and sixty-nine? That's thirteen centimetres in one century!
    draw d1896 d1896_l d1996 d1996_l top1 top2 grew

    quiz "Where did Dutch men born in 1896 rank?" reveal.text 12th reveal.at.x 180 reveal.at.y 440 reveal.size 64
        intro: Then the second question.
        right: Twelfth. Swedes, Norwegians and Americans all stood taller.
        * 1st
        * 4th
        + 12th
        * 20th

B: Americans? So the Americans were the giants once?
    draw us96 us96_l

A: Among them. But American men have hardly grown since those born in the 1950s, while the Dutch kept going.
    draw us us_l

    erase top1 top2 grew

B: So what did the Dutch do? Eat more cheese?
    draw why

A: More and better food, and far fewer childhood infections. Height is a record of how well children grew up.
    highlight why

    erase why d1896 d1896_l us96 us96_l us us_l d1996 d1996_l

A: And the Dutch didn't even grow the most.
    draw nlf nlbar nlbar_l grow_t

A: Men in Iran grew about sixteen and a half centimetres.
    draw irf irbar irbar_l

B: So I'm not short. I was just born in the wrong century.
    highlight irbar

